Package: QuantumData
Type: Package
Title: Datasets for SOA Exam PA – Predictive Analytics
Version: 0.5.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guanglai", "Li", role = c("ctb")),
    person("Sam", "Castillo", email = "Sam@PredictiveInsightsAI.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Date: 2025-02-22
Description: Provides the complete collection of datasets used in Exam PA: Predictive Analytics
    training materials and practice exams at Predictive Insights (<https://PredictiveInsightsAI.com/>).
    Includes cleaned insurance, financial, marketing, time-series, and risk modeling datasets
    designed to support GLM, tree-based models, time-series forecasting, unsupervised learning,
    model validation, and business communication tasks — exactly as seen in the SOA Exam PA syllabus.
